        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barakooyinka Ay Helaan Kuwa Ilaah Addeeca",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddaad aad u dhegaysataan codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah, oo intaad xajisaan aad yeeshaan amarradiisa aan maanta idinku amrayo oo dhan, Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu wuxuu idinka wada sare marin doonaa quruumaha dunida oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo barakooyinkan oo dhammuna way idinku soo degi doonaan, wayna idin soo gaadhi doonaan, haddaad codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah dhegaysataan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ku barakaysnaan doontaan magaalada, oo waxaad ku barakaysnaan doontaan duurka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa barakaysnaan doona midhaha jidhkiinna, iyo midhaha dhulkiinna, iyo midhaha xoolihiinna oo ah dhasha lo'diinna iyo tan idihiinna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa barakaysnaan doona dambiishiinna iyo weelkiinna aad wax ku cajiintaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waad barakaysnaan doontaan markaad gudaha soo gashaan, oo waad barakaysnaan doontaan markaad dibadda u baxdaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo cadaawayaashiinna idinku kaca Rabbigu wuxuu ka dhigi doonaa in hortiinna lagu laayo. Jid qudha ayay idinkaga iman doonaan, oo hortiinna ayay toddoba jid ku kala carari doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu ku amri doonaa inay barakadu idinku soo degto idinka, iyo maqsinnadiinna, iyo wax alla wixii aad gacanta ku qabataanba, oo wuxuu idinku barakayn doonaa dalka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu idin siinayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu idinka dhigan doonaa dad isaga qudhiisa quduus u ah, siduu idiinku dhaartay, haddaad amarrada Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah xajisaan oo aad jidadkiisana ku socotaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadka dunida oo dhammu waxay arki doonaan in laydiinku yeedhay magicii Rabbiga, wayna idinka cabsan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wanaag buu idiinku badin doonaa midhaha jidhkiinna, iyo midhaha xoolihiinna, iyo midhaha dhulkiinna idinkoo jooga dalka Rabbigu awowayaashiin ugu dhaartay inuu idin siinayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu idiin furi doonaa khasnaddiisa wanaagsan ee samada inuu dalkiinna roob siiyo xilligiisa, iyo inuu wada barakeeyo shuqulka aad gacanta ku qabataan oo dhan, oo idinku quruumo badan baad wax deymin doontaan, waxbase ma amaahan doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu idinka dhigayaa madaxa, idinkana dhigi maayo dabada, oo weligiin waxaad ahaanaysaan kuwa sarreeya, oo noqon maysaan kuwa hooseeya, haddaad dhegaysataan amarrada Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah oo aan maanta idinku amrayo, oo intaad xajisaan aad yeeshaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo aydaan erayada aan maanta idinku amrayo gees uga leexan xagga midigta iyo xagga bidixda toona, inaad ilaahyo kale daba gashaan oo aad u adeegtaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkaaraha Ku Dhaca Kuwa Aan Ilaah Addeecin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddaydnan dhegaysan codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah, inaad xajisaan oo aad wada yeeshaan amarradiisa iyo qaynuunnadiisa aan maanta idinku amrayo, markaas inkaarahan oo dhammu way idinku soo degi doonaan oo idin soo gaadhi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ku inkaarnaan doontaan magaalada oo waxaad ku inkaarnaan doontaan duurka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa inkaarnaan doona dambiishiinna iyo weelkiinna aad wax ku cajiintaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa inkaarnaan doona midhaha jidhkiinna iyo midhaha dhulkiinna, iyo dhasha lo'diinna iyo tan idihiinna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waad inkaarnaan doontaan markaad gudaha soo gashaan, oo waad inkaarnaan doontaan markaad dibadda u baxdaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu idinku soo dejin doonaa inkaar iyo dhibaato, oo wuu idinku canaanan doonaa wax alla wixii aad gacanta ku qabataan oo dhan jeeraad baabba'daan oo aad haddiiba halligantaan, waana sharka falimihiinna, oo aad iiga tagteen aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu idinku dhejin doonaa balaayada, jeeruu idinka baabbi'iyo dalka aad u gelaysaan inaad hantidaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiguna wuxuu idinku dhufan doonaa taagdarro, iyo qandho, iyo gubasho, iyo kulayl daran, iyo seef, iyo beera-engeeg, iyo caariyaysi, oo iyana way idin eryan doonaan ilaa aad halligantaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo samada idinka korraysaa waxay noqon doontaa naxaas, oo dhulka idinka hooseeyaana wuxuu noqon doonaa bir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu roobka dalkiinna wuxuu ka dhigi doonaa budo iyo boodh, oo waxaasu samaday idinkaga soo degi doonaan ilaa aad baabba'daan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu ka dhigi doonaa in laydinku laayo cadaawayaashiinna hortooda, oo iyaga jid qudha baad kaga iman doontaan, oo hortooda ayaad toddoba jid ku kala carari doontaan, oo boqortooyooyinka dunida oo dhammu waad ku dhex rogrogmi doontaan hore iyo dib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meydkiinnu wuxuu cunto u noqon doonaa haadka hawada oo dhan iyo dugaagga dhulka, oo mid iyaga ka eryana lama arki doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu idinku ridi doonaa boogtii Masar, iyo kasoobaxyo, iyo cadho, iyo xajiin aydaan ka bogsan karin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu wuxuu idinku ridi doonaa waalli iyo indhabbeel iyo naxdin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hadhkii baad u haabhaaban doontaan sida indhooluhu gudcurka u haabhaabto, oo jidadkiinna kuma liibaani doontaan, laakiinse had iyo goorba waa laydin dulmi doonaa oo waa laydin dhici doonaa, oo mid idin badbaadiyana lama arki doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naag baad guursan doontaa, laakiinse nin kalaa la seexan doona, guri baad dhisan doontaa, laakiinse degi maysid, beercanab baad beeran doontaa, laakiinse midhihiisa ku isticmaali maysid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dibigaaga ayaa hortaada lagu gowrici doono, idahaagana waxaa la siin doonaa cadaawayaashaada, oo mid ku badbaadiyana lama arki doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashiinna iyo gabdhihiinna waxaa la siin doonaa dad kale, oo indhihiinnuna way eegi doonaan, oo maalinta oo dhan waxaad la taag darnaan doontaan xiiso aad iyaga u qabtaan, oo gacantiinnuna xoog ma yeelan doonto innaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo midhaha dhulkiinna iyo hawshiinna oo dhan waxaa cuni doona quruun aydaan aqoon, oo weligiin waxaad ahaan doontaan dad la dulmo oo la burburiyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo taas daraaddeed waxaad la waalan doontaan waxa indhihiinnu arki doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu lowyaha iyo lugaha tan iyo tin iyo cedhib wuxuu idinka gelin doonaa boogo aydaan ka bogsan karin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu idinka iyo boqorkiinna aad boqran doontaanba u geeyn doonaa quruun idinka iyo awowayaashiinba aydaan aqoon, oo halkaas waxaad ugu adeegi doontaan ilaahyo kale oo qoryo iyo dhagax ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadyowga Rabbigu idiin geeyn doono oo dhan dhexdooda waxaad ku ahaan doontaan yaab iyo maahmaah iyo halqabsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad beerta u qaadan doontaan abuur badan, wax yar baadse ka soo urursan doontaan, maxaa yeelay, waxaa cuni doona ayax. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad beeran doontaan beero canab ah, waanad fali doontaan, laakiinse khamrina ma cabbi doontaan, canabna kama guran doontaan, waayo, waxaa cuni doona dixiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdimihiinna oo dhan dhexdooda waxaa idiinku oolli doona geedo saytuun ah, laakiinse saliid kuma subkan doontaan, waayo, saytuunkiinna midhuhu way ka daadan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad dhali doontaan wiilal iyo gabdho, laakiinse iyagu kuwiinna ma ahaan doonaan, maxaa yeelay, maxaabiis ahaan bay idiinka tegi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhirtiinna oo dhan iyo midhaha dhulkiinnaba waxaa lahaan doona ayax. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qariibka dhexdiinna ku jira ayaa idinka sare mari doona, oo idinkuna hoos baad u sii degi doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu wax buu idin deymin doonaa, idinkuse wax ma deymin doontaan, madaxa buu noqon doonaa, idinkuse dabada baad noqon doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkaarahan oo dhammu idinkay idinku soo degi doonaan, wayna idin eryan doonaan oo idin soo gaadhi doonaan ilaa aad baabba'daan, maxaa yeelay, ma aydaan dhegaysan codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah, inaad xajisaan amarradiisa iyo qaynuunnadiisa uu idinku amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay calaamad iyo yaab ku dul ahaan doonaan idinka iyo farcankiinnaba weligiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maxaa yeelay, idinku Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah wax kasta oo uu idinku badiyey aawadood uguguma aydaan adeegin faraxsanaan iyo qalbi reyreeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed cadaawayaashiinna Rabbigu idiin soo diri doono ayaad ugu adeegi doontaan gaajo iyo harraad iyo qaawanaan iyo adigoo wax kasta u baahan, oo wuxuu qoorta idinka saari doonaa harqood bir ah, ilaa uu idin baabbi'iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu meel fog oo dhulka darafkiisa ah idinkaga keeni doonaa quruun sida gorgorka u duulaysa oo aydaan afkeeda garanayn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo ah quruun weji cabsi badan, oo aan dadka waayeelka ah maamuusin, aan dhallaankana u nixin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkaasu wuxuu cuni doonaa midhaha xoolihiinna iyo midhaha dhulkiinna, ilaa aad baabba'daan, oo weliba idiinkama tegi doono hadhuudh, iyo khamri, iyo saliid, iyo dhasha lo'diinna, iyo tan idihiinna, ilaa uu idin halligo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meel kasta oo dhulkiinna ah ayuu dhammaan irdihiinna idinku hareerayn doonaa ilaa derbiyadiinna deyrka dheer ee aad isku hallayseen ay soo wada dhacaan, oo wuxuu idinku hareerayn doonaa irdihiinna oo dhan ee dhulka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu idin siiyey oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad cuni doontaan midhaha jidhkiinna, kaasoo ah hilibka wiilashiinna iyo gabdhihiinna Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu uu idin siiyey, waana markaad gashaan hareeraynta iyo cidhiidhiga ay cadaawayaashiinnu idinku cidhiidhin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninka idinku dhex jira oo idiinku jilicsan, oo qabow ku noolaan jiray, wuxuu il shar ah ku dayi doonaa walaalkiis, iyo naagtiisa laabta kaga jiifta, iyo kuwa carruurtiisa ka hadhay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si uusan midkoodna wax uga siin hilibka carruurtiisa oo uu cuni doono, maxaa yeelay, isaga waxba uma hadhi doonaan intii uu ku jiro hareeraynta iyo cidhiidhiga ay cadaawayaashiinnu irdihiinna oo dhan idinkaga cidhiidhin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo naagta jilicsan, oo idinku dhex jirta oo qabow ku noolaan jirtay oo aan u quudhin inay cagteeda cad dhulka dhigto nolosheedii qaboobayd oo jilicsanayd aawadeed, waxay il shar ah ku dayi doontaa ninkeeda laabta kaga jiifa, iyo wiilkeeda iyo gabadheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayna ka qarsan doontaa mandheerta ka soo dhex baxdo labadeeda lugood, iyo carruurteeda ay dhasho, waayo, qarsoodi bay iyaga u cuni doontaa iyadoo wax kasta u baahan, intay ku jirto hareeraynta iyo cidhiidhiga ay cadaawayaashiinnu irdihiinna oo dhan idinkaga cidhiidhin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddeydnan dhawrin oo wada yeelin erayada sharcigan ee kitaabkan ku qoran oo dhan inaad ka cabsataan magacan ammaanta badan oo cabsida badan oo ah RABBIGA ILAAHIINNA AH, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaas Rabbigu wuxuu idinka iyo farcankiinnaba ku ridi doonaa belaayooyin yaab leh oo waaweyn oo wakhti dheer idinku raaga, iyo cudurro xunxun oo wakhti dheer idinku raaga, iyo cudurro xunxun oo wakhti dheer idinku raaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu idinku soo dejin doonaa cudurradii Masar oo dhan oo aad ka cabsan jirteen, oo way idinku dhegi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu wuxuu kaloo idinku soo dejin doonaa ilaa aad wada baabba'daan cudur kasta iyo belaayo kasta oo aan ku qornayn kitaabka sharcigan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo in kastoo aad u faro badnaydeen sida xiddigaha samada oo kale waxaa uun idinka hadhi doona in yar oo dhawr ah, maxaa yeelay, codkii Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah ayaad dhegaysan weydeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidii Rabbigu idiinku farxay inuu wanaag idiin sameeyo oo uu idin badiyo, ayuu sidaas oo kale ugu farxi doonaa inuu idin halligo oo idin baabbi'iyo, oo idinka waa laydinka rujin doonaa dalka aad ugu socotaan inaad hantidaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.63",
